    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="page-title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: January 2025</p>

        <div class="content-box">
            <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>
                By accessing or using the RO Service Support website and services, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our website or services.
            </p>

            <h2>2. Services</h2>
            <p>
                RO Service Support provides water purifier repair, installation, maintenance, and AMC services in Bangalore and nearby areas. Service availability may vary depending on your location and technician availability.
            </p>

            <h2>3. Service Request & Booking</h2>
            <p>
                When you submit a service request through our website, you agree to provide accurate and complete information, including your name, mobile number, pin code, and address. Providing false information may result in service cancellation.
            </p>

            <h2>4. Pricing & Payment</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Standard service visit starts at ₹299 and includes a basic checkup.</li>
                <li>Any spare parts, filters, or additional repairs will be charged separately.</li>
                <li>Final pricing will be communicated to you before starting the work.</li>
                <li>Payment can be made via UPI, cash, or card at the time of service.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>5. Warranty</h2>
            <p>
                All repairs performed by RO Service Support come with a 30-day service warranty. This warranty covers only the specific repair or service performed. It does not cover damages caused by misuse, physical damage, water quality issues, or tampering by third parties.
            </p>

            <h2>6. Cancellation & Rescheduling</h2>
            <p>
                You may cancel or reschedule your service request by calling our support number. We request at least 2 hours' notice for cancellations to allow us to reassign the technician.
            </p>

            <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>
                RO Service Support is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our services. Our maximum liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount paid for the specific service.
            </p>

            <h2>8. Customer Responsibilities</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Provide accurate contact and address details</li>
                <li>Ensure someone is available at the address during the scheduled time</li>
                <li>Provide safe access to the water purifier</li>
                <li>Inform us of any pre-existing damage or issues</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>9. Intellectual Property</h2>
